Cell["\<\
{1} is the Dynkin coefficients of the (highest weight of the) fundamental \
representation of SU(2). While the generators are ordered differently form \
the common choice based on the Pauli matrices, they are internally consistent \
with generators produced for all other representations.\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1512774809,ExpressionUUID->"94bd8892-cb52-480d-b5fb-9b595072bca9"]
}, Dynamic[CurrentValue[
 EvaluationNotebook[], {TaggingRules, "Openers", "ExampleSection", "0"}, 
